                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5723827401" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3262" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3262/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3262"&gt;#3262&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
