                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.4.0"&gt;3.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Major Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In RESP3, by default the library now uses &lt;strong&gt;separate&lt;/strong&gt; connections for pub/sub; see &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5743491664" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3264" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3264/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3264"&gt;#3264&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart-client-handoffs is now enabled by default on Redis Enterprise and AMR; see &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5498373438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3248" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3248/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3248"&gt;#3248&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some logging events incorrectly used duplicated ids - resolved; see &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5764763888" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3266" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3266/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3266"&gt;#3266&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;All Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recover promptly from a cluster failover; fix the configuration channel under RESP3 and with a channel prefix (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5612698665" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3254" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3254/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3254"&gt;#3254&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5644620078" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3255" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3255/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3255"&gt;#3255&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preserve binary members as VectorSetRange bounds by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Laurianti/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Laurianti"&gt;@Laurianti&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5672745123" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3256" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3256/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3256"&gt;#3256&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart client handoffs: reinstate auto-enlistment for the hosted providers and remove [Experimental] by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5498373438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3248" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3248/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3248"&gt;#3248&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: fix retry-category test in the custom RetryPolicy sample by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5760479821" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3265" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3265/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3265"&gt;#3265&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix duplicate LoggerMessage event ids; add a guard test by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5764763888" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3266" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3266/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3266"&gt;#3266&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scan: observe the faults of abandoned page tasks after a sync timeout or dispose (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5706866682" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3260" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3260/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3260"&gt;#3260&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5776359574" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3267" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3267/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3267"&gt;#3267&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report the outcome of every physical connection attempt, identifying the client certificate used by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5678264874" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3257" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3257/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3257"&gt;#3257&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a dedicated pub/sub connection under RESP3 by default by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5743491664" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3264" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3264/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3264"&gt;#3264&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tooling&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs(agents): add create-implementation-plan-for-redis-api-change skill by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/uglide/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/uglide"&gt;@uglide&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5776375101" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3268" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3268/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3268"&gt;#3268&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Laurianti/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Laurianti"&gt;@Laurianti&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5672745123" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3256" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3256/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3256"&gt;#3256&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
